{"text": "APPENDIX 11\n\n> IPS\nMn!\n\nOctober 22, 1985\n\nMr. Derrick Crawford\nROR MacDonald, Inc.\n2455 est rue Ontario\nMontreal, Canada 1211103\n\nDear Derrick:\n\nWe have analyzed the biological activity of the flavoring, Firnova AT-1,\nas furnished by Firmenich. We did not find any changes in biological activity\nof the flavoring itself or when applied to a cigarette up to 1.08 by weight.\nOur procedure to screen biological activity involves determining the\nmutagenicity of two strains of Salmonella typhimurium (Anes test) on the\nflavoring and the smoke condensate in a dose-response manner.\n\nDr. Franz Mueller of Firmenich has supplied 2 list of the components of\nPimova AT-1. I have reviewed health effects of these components and do not\nanticipate any potential for adverse health effects. \u2018The components of\nFirnova AT-1 are listed on the Hunter List singly and as a Toasting flavor\nj.e., Maillard reaction products composed of amino acids. The upper limit\nestablished for Toasting flavors is 2.08 by dry weight on the Hunter List.\n\nAt the levels evaluated and the levels Mr. Frank Lane has stated that you\nintend to use, I see no reason for advising against using this additive at\nthose levels.\nSincerely,\nME\nRobert L. Suber\nRLS/dbd\n\ncc: Dr. A. W. Hayes\nMr. Prank Lane\n\nVIG. os Jobeeee Company\n\n1600 LL60S", "words": [{"text": "APPENDIX", "x0": 86, "y0": 46, "x1": 157, "y1": 59, "conf": 81.0}, {"text": "11", "x0": 170, "y0": 50, "x1": 182, "y1": 59, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": ">", "x0": 481, "y0": 172, "x1": 491, "y1": 179, "conf": 15.0}, {"text": "IPS", "x0": 502, "y0": 171, "x1": 528, "y1": 179, "conf": 18.0}, {"text": "Mn!", "x0": 481, "y0": 181, "x1": 527, "y1": 191, "conf": 59.0}, {"text": "October", "x0": 442, "y0": 226, "x1": 495, "y1": 237, "conf": 87.0}, {"text": "22,", "x0": 505, "y0": 226, "x1": 523, "y1": 238, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "1985", "x0": 535, "y0": 226, "x1": 564, "y1": 236, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "Mr.", "x0": 76, "y0": 29